OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 23 APR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Haydn
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how
OL,6,     GHaydn's popularity grew at this
OL,7,     Gtime throughout Europe.
OL,8,G1700FIn Tune
OL,9,     GViola player Peter Mallinson
OL,10,     Gperforms chamber music from his
OL,11,     Gnew album.
OL,12,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,13,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,14,     Gsoundscape of classical delights,
OL,15,     Gfrom Bach to Rachmaninov.
OL,16,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,17,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,18,     GOrchestra and conductor Elim Chan
OL,19,     Greveal the deadly secrets of
OL,20,     GBartok's thrilling work
OL,21,     G'Bluebeard's Castle' with the
OL,22,     Ghelp of two world-class soloists.
